,51.22637,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Flingern – my favourite district</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/duesseldorf/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>6.80372,51.22864,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. EKŌ-Haus in Niederkassel</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/duesseldorf/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>6.7455,51.23961,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Carlsplatz &amp; market</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/duesseldorf/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>6.77357,51.22343,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Hofgarten &amp; Benrath Palace</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Plan half a day for the palace. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/duesseldorf/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>6.87023,51.16104,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>12. Japanese cuisine: ramen, sushi &amp; bakeries</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come at lunch for lunch menus. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/duesseldorf/#o12</description><Point><coordinates>6.78745,51.22148,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
